	"data": "The Half-Finished Sovereignty: Why Owning Your Data Means Owning Your Questions\n\nConnection between: research-threads ↔ technology-ethics-framework\n\nThe Surface\n\nOne is a research agenda — a prioritized list of what cithoreal wants to investigate. The other is an ethics framework — who controls his data, how it's stored, what rights he has over it. One is about what to ask. The other is about who owns the answers. They seem like different layers: inquiry vs. infrastructure, curiosity vs.…",
